# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REAL EMAIL OTP DELIVERY (Choose Option 1, 2, or 3)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Option 1: Gmail SMTP (Recommended, 100% Free, 500 emails/day)
# 1. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 2. Generate a 16-letter App Password for "Mail"
# 3. Paste your Gmail address and the 16-letter password below:
GMAIL_USER=your_email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

# Option 2: Brevo / Sendinblue (Free 300 emails/day, no credit card)
# 1. Sign up free at https://www.brevo.com
# 2. Get your API key at https://app.brevo.com/settings/keys/api
BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib-...
BREVO_SENDER=your_verified_email@gmail.com

# Option 3: Resend (Free 3,000 emails/month, 100/day)
# 1. Sign up free at https://resend.com
# 2. Get API key from https://resend.com/api-keys
RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
RESEND_FROM=Sobagu Kannada <onboarding@resend.dev>
